   "h3": "",
   "texte": "Baroque Symphony Sicilian Caponata | Agrumea Farm\nSKIP TO CONTENT\nIT\nEN\nM\nM\nE\nE\nN\nN\nU\nU\nC\nC\nL\nL\nO\nO\nS\nS\nE\nE\nS\nI\nC\nI\nL\nI\nA\nN\nC\nA\nP\nO\nN\nA\nT\nA\nSavoury\nMade in\nSicily – Italy\nRich in notes and flavors, like Baroque music: sweet and sour, and irresistible!\nIngredients: bell peppers, eggplant, celery, sunflower oil, onion, carrots, green\nolives (olives, salt, antioxidant: ascorbic acid, acidity regulator: citric acid), sugar,\ncapers (capers, salt), white wine vinegar (contains sulfites), sun-dried tomato\n(tomato, salt), black pepper.\nMay contain: gluten, tree nuts, mustard, sesame, soy\nUSEFUL TIPS\nPerfect to open a meal or to elevate a sun-drenched\nbuffet. Serve it over slices of rustic homemade bread,\nor pair it with traditional Sicilian cheeses like\nRagusano DOP, matured Sicilian Pecorino, or savory\nricotta salata. It also makes an exquisite\naccompaniment to grilled meats or fresh catch of the\nday. Keep away from heat sources and direct\nsunlight. After opening, store in the refrigerator and\nconsume within 3-4 days.\nAVAILABLE WEIGHTS\n190g\n1kg\n3kg\nSHELF LIFE\n36 months\nUse the left and right arrow keys to browse the photos.\nT\nH\nE\nO\nT\nH\nE\nR\nP\nR\nO\nD\nU\nC\nT\nS\n©2026 | AGRUMEA FARM\nAzienda Agricola Sebastiano Piazza\nVAT IT01748040894\nHome\nPantry\nProduction\nExperience\nAbout\nContacts\nShop\nREGISTERED OFFICE\nVia Generale Ameglio, 13\n95123 - Catania\nOPERATIONAL OFFICE\nSeconda strada c.da piana s. Croce sn\n96014 - Floridia (SR)\nFOLLOW US\n@instagram\nDo you have a question or would you like to find\nout more about us? Drop us a line, we’d be\ndelighted to tell you all about Agrumea Farm.\ninfo@agrumeafarm.it\nPrivacy & Cookies\nCookies\nWe use technical cookies and, only with your consent, analytics cookies to understand how the site is used. You can accept, reject or choose in detail.\nPrivacy & Cookie Policy\nAccept\nReject\nManage preferences"
  },
