   "texte": "Baroque Symphony Sicilian Caponata | Agrumea Farm\nSKIP TO CONTENT\nIT\nEN\nM\nM\nE\nE\nN\nN\nU\nU\nC\nC\nL\nL\nO\nO\nS\nS\nE\nE\nS\nI\nC\nI\nL\nI\nA\nN\nC\nA\nP\nO\nN\nA\nT\nA\nSavoury\nRich in notes and flavors, like\nBaroque music: sweet and sour,\nand irresistible!\nIngredients: bell peppers,\neggplant, celery, sunflower oil,\nonion, carrots, green olives\n(olives, salt, antioxidant: ascorbic\nacid, acidity regulator: citric\nacid), sugar, capers (capers, salt),\nwhite wine vinegar\n(contains sulfites), sun-dried\ntomato (tomato, salt), black\npepper.\nMay contain: gluten, tree nuts, mustard,\nsesame, soy\nUSEFUL TIPS\nPerfect to open a meal or to elevate a\nsun-drenched buffet. Serve it over slices\nof rustic homemade bread, or pair it with\ntraditional Sicilian cheeses like Ragusano\nDOP, matured Sicilian Pecorino, or savory\nricotta salata. It also makes an exquisite\naccompaniment to grilled meats or fresh\ncatch of the day. Keep away from heat\nsources and direct sunlight. After\nopening, store in the refrigerator and\nconsume within 3-4 days.\nAVAILABLE WEIGHTS\n190g\n1kg\n3kg\nSHELF LIFE\n36 months\nUse the left and right arrow keys to browse the photos.\nT\nH\nE\nO\nT\nH\nE\nR\nP\nR\nO\nD\nU\nC\nT\nS\n©2026 | AGRUMEA FARM\nAzienda Agricola Sebastiano Piazza\nVAT IT01748040894\nHome\nPantry\nProduction\nExperience\nAbout\nContacts\nShop\nREGISTERED OFFICE\nVia Generale Ameglio,\n13\n95123 - Catania\nOPERATIONAL OFFICE\nSeconda strada c.da\npiana s. Croce sn\n96014 - Floridia (SR)\nFOLLOW US\n@instagram\nDo you have a question or would you like\nto find out more about us? Drop us a\nline, we’d be delighted to tell you all\nabout Agrumea Farm.\ninfo@agrumeafarm.it\nPrivacy & Cookies\nCookies\nWe use technical cookies and, only with your consent, analytics cookies to understand how the site is used. You can accept, reject or choose in detail.\nPrivacy & Cookie Policy\nAccept\nReject\nManage preferences"
